        </BoQBkdn>
      </BoQInfo>
      <BoQBody>
        <BoQCtgy ID="GW_2007865" RNoPart="01">
          <LblTx>
            <p>
              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">ROAD CONSTRUCTION / REINSTATEMENT</span>
            </p>
          </LblTx>
          <NotApplBoQ>No</NotApplBoQ>
          <BoQBody>
            <BoQCtgy ID="GW_2007866" RNoPart="01">
              <LblTx>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Site setup for road construction / reinstatement works </span>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">in the entire route area of the planned [PROJEKT_001].</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">BE civil works water pipeline in the trade civil works water pipeline</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">BE supply and lay the water pipeline in the trade supply and </span>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">lay the water pipeline.</span>
                </p>
                <p/>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Traffic safety measures for </span>
                  <span style="text-decoration:underline;background:#FFFFFF;">all</span>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> tendered work </span>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- Road construction / reinstatement</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- Civil works water pipeline</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- Supply and lay the water pipeline</span>
                </p>
                <p/>
              </LblTx>
              <NotApplBoQ>No</NotApplBoQ>
              <BoQBody>
                <Itemlist>
                  <Remark ID="GW_2031323">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Nature conservation law requirements for carrying out the overall project</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">[PROJEKT_001]. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">All points listed below become part of the contract with regard to the realisation of the project and must be complied with without fail:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- Site setups of any kind may exclusively only be erected and operated outside the</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  designated FFH - area (Natura2000) see overview of protected areas,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  . They must lie close to roads and paths.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- Refuelling of vehicles and machines is to be carried out exclusively outside</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  the FFH - area (forest area) , as well as the adjoining areas </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  . see above site setups.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">In order to rule out an impairment of the habitats of the greater mouse-eared bat             (bat) in the FFH - area " Obere Argen und Seitentäler" </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">  , the work in and directly adjoining the </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">  FFH - area is to be carried out only in daylight.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">  Lighting of the site is prohibited!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- The WL - route runs between station 0+580 and 0+600 by means of </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  directional drilling through the open-land biotope wetland in the area of the </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  skid trail forest path. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  The area outside the skid trail must not be impaired and is</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  to be fenced off by the AN with site fences!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- As a matter of principle no substances hazardous to water may be supplied to the site </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  and installed.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In general the AN has to inform himself precisely about these circumstances before the start of the work, also by means of overview drawings, if necessary site visit.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">All additional cost resulting from this is to be included in the price in the site overheads and is not paid separately! </span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Nature conservation law requirements for carrying out the overall project</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Remark ID="GW_2007867">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note for all items tendered in the overall - LV </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">site setup and traffic safety measures.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The estimator has to observe for these items the construction description, the special contract conditions and the execution design as basis for the cost estimate.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The site setup tendered here and is to be priced for the trade road construction works, the traffic safety measures for all work in the overall LV</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Any additional work in the event of a possible winter break is to be included in the price by the AN!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The site setups of the other trades civil works water pipeline, supply and lay water pipeline, as well as of the 2 directional drillings, are tendered in the respective trades.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">The project can, at [PERSON_125] of the AN, be carried out across the years  2025 and 2026 in up to 2 passes.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">An execution time with 1 pass in 2025 or 2026 is also </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">possible,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">The overall project must be completed by the end of June 2026 at the latest.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Work can be carried out at the same time in different areas (several work locations),</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">The coordination of the individual work locations is the responsibility of the AN in agreement with the site management of the AG.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The deployment of up to 2 crews at the same time </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">(civil works and laying = 1 crew), at up to 2 locally separate work</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">locations is to be included in the price as well!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">For the required traffic-law orders, a precise agreement is to be held here with the responsible road traffic authority.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">The complete local and regional diversion is arranged and carried out by the AN.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">It is mandatory to ensure that the residents on site have constant access and [PERSON_043], as far as possible.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The individual sub-sections are to be defined accordingly and if necessary realised with temporary transition solutions in junction areas.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The work in the forest area is additionally to be coordinated with the person responsible at the </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">forest owners' association (Mr [PERSON_079]).</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">An additional payment beyond the tendered BE and traffic safety items items does not take place!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note for all items tendered in the overall - LV </span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Item ID="GW_2007868" RNoPart="0001">
                    <Qty>1.000</Qty>
                    <QU>psch</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <StLNo Type="StLK">1010110721</StLNo>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Bring to the site and provide equipment, tools and other</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">operating resources that are required for the execution of the</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">construction work in accordance with the contract, and</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- as far as the use of equipment is not paid separately</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- set up ready for operation incl. the work</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">necessary for this. Construct the required fixed</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">installations. Site offices, accommodation, workshops, storage</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">sheds and the like, as far as required, transport to</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">site, erect and furnish. Power, [PERSON_029], tele-</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">phone connection as well as disposal facilities and the like</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">for the site, as far as required, construct. If</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">needed lay out storage areas, other hardstandings and</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">paths in the site area. Carry out topsoil works</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. removal of vegetation for the site</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">setup, as far as required. Procure</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">areas, if those made available by the AG</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">are not sufficient. Costs for keeping available, maintaining and</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">operating the equipment, installations and facilities</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. rents, lease, fees and the like are not</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">paid with this lump sum, but with the unit prices</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">of the partial works concerned. As far as</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">separate items for setting up the site are not</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">contained in the bill of quantities for certain</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">work, the lump sum applies</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">to all work of this division of the bill of</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">quantities.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Access to the site exists.</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Set up the site</span>
                              </p>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">This LV div.*access exist.</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="GW_2007869" RNoPart="0002">
                    <Qty>1.000</Qty>
                    <QU>psch</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <StLNo Type="StLK">1010111202</StLNo>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Clear the site of all equipment, installations, facilities and</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">the like. Restore used areas and paths in accordance with the</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">original condition. As far as separate items for</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">clearing the site are not contained in the</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">bill of quantities for certain</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">work, the lump sum applies</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">to all work of this division of the bill of</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">quantities.</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Clear the site</span>
                              </p>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">This LV div.</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="GW_2007871" RNoPart="0003">
                    <Qty>1.000</Qty>
                    <QU>psch</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Facilities for traffic safety and traffic control acc. to StVO  during construction work on single-carriageway roads for </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">local traffic diversion</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> including barriers and lighting of the site for the entire construction period with full and partial closure to through traffic see note item, as well as obtaining the traffic-law order, incl. fee.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Erect, constantly maintain and operate, if necessary relocate and dismantle, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">execution for the entire construction of the structure, for all trades.  </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Replace damaged and lost parts.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Residents' traffic is made possible along the construction section.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">60 per cent of the lump sum is paid after erection ready for operation, the rest after dismantling of the traffic safety facilities.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Securing with electric warning lights</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Traffic signs, traffic devices and equipment are provided and kept available on site by the AN.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">If smooth steel plates are used for covering excavation pits and trenches ( for temporarily carrying traffic across ), the party responsible for traffic safety has to draw attention to the associated dangers by signage.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The additional technical contract conditions (ZTV-A), as well as the guidelines for the safeguarding of work sites on roads ( RSA 95 ) are the basis of the construction contract and are to be strictly complied with.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution acc. to traffic sign plan submitted by the AN.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Carry out, record and document inspection of the entire work site safeguarding acc. to ZTV - SA twice daily, on non-working days once daily.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note: execution and billing for all tendered trades                 in this item, billing for individual trades </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">                does not take place separately!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Facilities for traffic safety and traffic control acc. to StVO  during construction work on single-carriageway roads for local traffic diversion including barriers and lighting of the site for the entire construction period with full and partial closure to through traffic see note item, as well as obtaining the traffic-law order, incl. fee.</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="GW_2007872" RNoPart="0004">
                    <Qty>1.000</Qty>
                    <QU>psch</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Work as item last described in full wording,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">but facilities for traffic safety and traffic control acc. to StVO,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">for </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">regional traffic diversion.</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">	</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution with full closures of inter-municipal connecting roads, agricultural roads and forest paths as connecting and access routes for agriculture, forest management and further traffic on a smaller scale. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The estimator is urgently recommended to inspect the site!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Work as item last described in full wording,</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="GW_2007875" RNoPart="0005">
                    <Qty>60.000</Qty>
                    <QU>m</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Supply, erect, maintain site fence H = 2,0 m and remove again after completion of the work.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In areas in addition to the basic barrier facilities, which are to be included in the price in the item site safeguarding. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Execution and billing only for corridors additionally required by the AG </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">, such as temporary passages or separate accesses, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">exclusively after prior consultation with the site management!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Supply, erect, maintain site fence H = 2,0 m and remove again after completion of the work.</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
