                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">best procedure is discussed once more in advance with those responsible.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">A partial cutting back of the overhanging branches (clearance profile for the construction machines) is likewise determined in this connection.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
