                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">to trench excavation for making an access pit,</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">for connection to the existing water pipeline GGG DN 300</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">beside existing water meter shaft at the</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">end of construction station 1+067,</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. locating the line, exposing it, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">hand excavation at existing line.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Dewatering of escaping pipeline water.</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Additional excavation, backfill again and compact.</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">For the connection of new line DN 300 to existing line DN 300 </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">area beside previous shaft that is to be omitted(is paid separately)</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">DZ NZ Isnyberg - 365.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">L = approx. 3,00 m, B = approx. 2,00 m, T = up to approx. 2,00 m.</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Billing per connection/reconnection point 1 piece.</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge to trench excavation for making access pit for cutting</span>
                                <br/>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">the existing water main DN 150 incl. locating the line,</span>
                                <br/>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">exposing it, hand excavation at existing line.</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="GW_2008005" RNoPart="0024">
                    <Qty>675.000</Qty>
                    <QU>m</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge to all trench items for the dimensionally accurate construction of the pipe trench for the PE pipes DA 355 and cast-iron pipeline  DN 300, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">(accurate in position and level +/- 1 cm) according to documents or taking into account the enclosed site plans and the longitudinal sections because of the low gradient of the planned subsections of the cast-iron pipeline. Compliance with the design for level and position of the pipeline is absolutely required in order to avoid intermediate high points and thus air pockets and to ensure the performance of the pipeline.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The dimensionally accurate construction of the pipe trench is to be checked and documented by a continuously performed digital target/actual position and level measurement or survey with Gauß-Krüger coordinates on the pipe invert.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Deviations of the dimensionally accurate pipe laying (above the tolerance of 1 cm) are to be remedied by the AN without delay.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Construction of the pipe trench in sections and thus all auxiliary and ancillary costs necessary for it as well as the increased time and effort are to be included in the EP.</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
