                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">for cutting the existing water pipeline AZ DN 100 for pulling in</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">a new house connection line PE DA 63 into the existing AZ pipe DN 100 in the area of the trench of the new water main DN 300 ZMU, </span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. locating the line, exposing it, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">hand excavation at existing line,</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">dewatering of escaping pipeline water,</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">backfill access pit (additional excavation) again and compact.</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Dimensions in addition to the main trench DN 300:</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">L = approx. 2 x 1,50 m left and right, B = approx. 1,50 m, T = up to approx. 2,25 m.</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Billing per access pit (additional excavation) 1 piece.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Station approx. 0+003 to 0+005.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note: pipe surround PE DA 63 all round with sand to be supplied,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">              and removal of material displaced by this is to be included in the price.</span>
                            </p>
