                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">hand excavation at existing line,</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">dewatering of escaping pipeline water,</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">backfill access pit again and compact.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution as [PERSON_175] for pulling a PE DA 63 pipe into the old water pipeline AZ DN 100 for the new house connection [PERSON_062]. 19</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">only if necessary (pulling in the PE DA 63 pipe in one length without [PERSON_175] possibly not possible).</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">L = approx. 2,50 m, B = approx. 1,50 m, T = up to approx. 2,25 m.</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Billing per access pit 1 piece.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note: pipe surround PE DA 63 all round with sand to be supplied,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">              and removal of material displaced by this is to be included in the price.</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
