                  <Item ID="GW_2032330" RNoPart="0027">
                    <Qty>20.000</Qty>
                    <QU>m</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Digging in and digging out again,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">or partial covering or covering over of emergency supply lines</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">PE - pipes DA 40 - 63 </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">or protective pipes DN 100,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">depth up to 20 cm,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">according to [PERSON_125] of the AN</span>
                              <br/>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">property access drives and other crossings.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. supply and removal again of installed material</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">with dismantling of the emergency supply.</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Digging in and digging out again,</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Remark ID="GW_2030614">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note on the storage area according to [PERSON_125] of the AN:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">The AN has to find and determine a suitable storage area himself, the costs are to be included in the overall measure and are not paid separately!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Set up storage area as interim storage for sampling of the excavated materials listed </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">below, operate and maintain it during the entire construction period and after completion of the work remove it again </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">without residue.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution essentially for displaced [PERSON_093] from road and path construction, pipe bedding of water pipeline, trench backfilling with imported material and other displacements by delivered backfill material.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In the geotechnical report by fm Geotechnik the following was found with regard to soil contamination:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">The topsoil</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> was examined for the parameters of the BBodSchV and Altlastenverordnung. </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">The 70% of the precautionary values are complied with</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">, the topsoil can be reinstalled on the areas of origin and on areas used for agriculture.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Results of soil samples [PERSON_033] and sand:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The soils show no elevated values or pollutant contents. The samples examined are classified as </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">BM - 0</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">(Z 0)</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">During excavation care is to be taken that filled soils are separated from natural soils.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">This also applies to the interim storage for sampling.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">If soil material is transported away from the site, stockpile-related sampling according to the regulations of LAGA PN98 is necessary at the interim storage, so that the material can be properly recycled or disposed of!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Total size approx. 20 x 25 m according to [PERSON_125] of the AN..</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Total quantity of material to be stored:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Road and path excavation gravel and [PERSON_033]                    approx. 100 m3,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">    </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Excavation displacement civil works water pipeline                   approx.  600 m3</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The total storage quantity of approx. 700 m3 is divided into the required stockpiles in consultation with the sampler commissioned by the AG and, depending on the analysis result, picked up again and reused.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The estimator has to include in the price that the size of the individual stockpiles, for the sake of overview and better sampling, does not exceed 300 m³.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Furthermore the AN has to provide all equipment for constructing the area, assistance with sampling, loading material again, as well as restoring the area to its original condition!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note: The sampling is carried out by an expert designated and </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">                commissioned by the AG!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note on the storage area according to [PERSON_125] of the AN:</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Item ID="GW_2008007" RNoPart="0028">
                    <Qty>500.000</Qty>
                    <QU>m3</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> to the soil movement of the items soil excavation water pipeline </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">PE DA 355 - GGG DN 300 ZMU for:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Loading of the displaced [PERSON_093], transporting and unloading in stockpiles on a suitable storage area of the AN for sampling for </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">further use.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Distance one way up to approx. 5 KM</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Storage area according to [PERSON_125] of the AN.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Should, in the course of the construction measure, excavation quantities be hauled not to the </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">interim storage but directly from the excavation location to reuse sites as specified by the municipalities or farmers involved, these quantities are to be documented for billing for the overall mass balance </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">according to haulage reports.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Billing is likewise done here in this item!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Before execution the site management of the AG is to be informed!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge to the soil movement of the items soil excavation water pipeline </span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="GW_2008008" RNoPart="0029">
                    <Qty>550.000</Qty>
                    <QU>m3</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge to the soil movement of the item soil excavation water pipelines</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">PE DA 355 and GGG DN 300 ZMU for:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">[PERSON_093] from the interim storage for sampling,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">pick up, load and for recycling as soil </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Z 0</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">(BM 0)</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> transport to recycling site of the AN and, incl. recycling fees, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">unload and document.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Recycling site of the AN </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">is to be named:..................................................................</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution after sampling of the [PERSON_093] and a corresponding</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">analysis result with </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Z 0</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> according to VwV Boden, or </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">BM 0</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> according to EBV.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Billing according to measurement (haulage reports) and cut profiles for displaced</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">soil material from the removal from the interim storage area and supply of </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">backfill materials with proof/reconciliation via the overall mass balance.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Billing by cbm.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note:</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> The work of this item also applies to [PERSON_093] from road and path construction in the course of the water pipeline measure,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Corresponding work is likewise billed here and is not tendered separately in the trade road and path construction!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge to the soil movement of the item soil excavation water pipelines</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Remark ID="GW_2008009">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note on the sampling and analysis of the soil material in interim storage:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The sampling and corresponding analysis of the soil material on the interim storage area is carried out on the part of the AG by an expert appointed by him.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">This work is not part of the tender.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In the planned construction sequence the AN has to take into account that a period of approx. 14 days is to be allowed for from the time of sampling until the analysis result.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note on the sampling and analysis of the soil material in interim storage:</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Remark ID="GW_2008010">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note on the items reuse of analysed </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">[PERSON_093] , BM 0 to [KENNZEICHEN_004] according to EBV, (Z0*, Z 1.1, Z 1.2 and Z2 according to VwV)</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Should the contractor, due to a lack of recycling sites,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">dispose of recyclable material of the classification value </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">BM 0 to [KENNZEICHEN_004] according to EBV, (Z0* to Z2 according to the VwV),</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">at a landfill, no additional cost may be </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">claimed by the him.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The unit price for a Z - item (BM - item)</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">stated in the bill of quantities,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">is therefore mandatory to be adhered to and billed, even if the </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">corresponding Z - material (BM material) is disposed of at a landfill.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The additional costs (additional cost) arising in the case of landfilling of the actual Z - material (BM material) </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">for stockpile formation, interim storage </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">and renewed stockpile sampling with chemical analyses according to DepV,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">are, incl. resulting delays and landfill costs,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">to be borne by the AN!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note on the items reuse of analysed </span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Item ID="GW_2008011" RNoPart="0030">
                    <Qty>25.000</Qty>
                    <QU>t</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge to the soil movement of the item soil excavation water pipelines</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">PE DA 355 and GGG DN 300 ZMU for:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">[PERSON_093] from the interim storage for sampling,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">pick up, load and for recycling as soil </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">BM 0* (Z 0*)</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> transport to recycling site of the AN and, incl. recycling fees, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">unload and document.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Recycling site of the AN </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">is to be named:..................................................................</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution after sampling of the [PERSON_093] and a corresponding</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">analysis result with  </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">BM 0*</span>
