                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
                  <Item ID="GW_2008064" RNoPart="0057">
                    <Qty>15.000</Qty>
                    <QU>St</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Reinstatement of field drains</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The following work is to be included in the price:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Exposing the lines of various materials(PVC, vitrified clay,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">concrete etc.),</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">diameter DN 60 - 100 mm,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">removing and disposing of the line up to the respective trench edge,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">securing the remaining line ends, incl. cleaning and preparing</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">for reconnection.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Construct line trench formation or intermediate formation level.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Supply and install PVC - U pipes DN 100, incl. 2 x transition</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">to existing, as well as approx. 2 - 3 further fittings (bends, Ü - sockets etc.),</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. pipe surround with sand or gravel 0/16 to be supplied all round 10 cm</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">and removal of displaced material pipe and pipe surround.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Total length of the line reinstatement on average up to approx. 3,50 m.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The reconnection is to be sur veyed in terms of position and documented by photo.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">All data are to be handed over to site management!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Reinstatement of field drains</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
                  <Item ID="GW_2008066" RNoPart="0058">
                    <Qty>50.000</Qty>
                    <QU>m</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge to item reinstatement of field drains</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
