            <BoQCtgy ID="GW_2008077" RNoPart="04">
              <LblTx>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Dewatering works for water pipeline works for all areas</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">open-cut construction</span>
                </p>
              </LblTx>
              <NotApplBoQ>No</NotApplBoQ>
              <BoQBody>
                <Itemlist>
                  <Remark ID="GW_2008078">
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note on all dewatering works:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;"> </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">The dewatering for launch and reception pits for the planned directional drillings is tendered in the respective items in the trade civil works in trenchless construction and is not paid here!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In the area of point water extraction locations (structures etc.) the dewatering is paid via pump sump and </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">pump operation.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In the area of water pipeline trenches an open dewatering for a</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">groundwater or stratum water extraction is paid in lfm.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">According to the expert report, for a water permeability coefficient of </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">kf = 1,0 x 10</span>
                              <span style="vertical-align:super;background:#FFFFFF;">-4 </span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">m/s the following water extraction quantities are assumed:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In the area [PERSON_006] station 1+000 forest path a dewatering in closed shoring with approx. 1,0 l/s and a drawdown target of approx. 1,60 m is to be carried out.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In the area of the water pipeline trenches station 0+990 to 1+067 a delivery rate of approx. 3 - 5 l/s is assumed in the area of in-situ moraine sands.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">After heavy precipitation, in highly permeable areas also </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">pump capacities up to approx. 10 l/s can become possible.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In the area of the open, sloped trenches of the meadow plots,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">stratum water in temporary form up to max. 1,0 l/s can occur in subareas.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The values listed here are found again in the items dewatering tendered</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">below.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note on all dewatering works:</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Remark>
