                          <Text>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Open dewatering according to free [PERSON_125] of the contractor for the laying of the complete water pipeline as far as there is a water inflow.       </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The pump operations, energy costs, pump with motor, discharge lines and all ancillary work are to be included in the price.           </span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Water inflow up to max. 8 m open trench </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">up to 5 l/s.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution and billing </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">only where groundwater is present</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">in the area of approx. station 0+990 to 1+070 forest area.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note: [PERSON_149] up to 1,0 l/s is paid separately!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
