                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. constant installing, maintaining and removing for the entire</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">duration of the groundwater extraction.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution for groundwater and stratum water extraction!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
