                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. fixed points for fixing the water pipeline in the shaft,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">incl. complete buoyancy protection </span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">against groundwater and </span>
