                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- 1 shaft penetration for main line PE DA 355 incl. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  required annular seals, , gas- and pressure-watertight!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- Cover slab with 1. opening DN 800 mm, eccentric,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  and 2. opening DN 450 mm for shaft hydrant (can at the [PERSON_125] of the AN also    be made on site), position of the openings see drawing</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- 2 concrete collars for opening DN 800 mm and opening DN 450 mm, </span>
                            </p>
