                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">for travel by heavy-duty crane and other machines.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution as a site road with gravel/crushed stone is not permitted!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
