                <p>
                  <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Pipeline construction DN 300 WV open-cut construction</span>
                </p>
              </LblTx>
              <NotApplBoQ>No</NotApplBoQ>
              <BoQBody>
                <Itemlist>
                  <Item ID="GW_2010164" RNoPart="0001">
                    <Qty>1.000</Qty>
                    <QU>psch</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> - </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">item for all pipe-laying and assembly works</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">in the connection area new line/</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">existing line GGG DN 300 at start of construction DZ NZ Isnyberg 400-401. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The following work is to be included in the price:</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- The entire connection work pipe supply- and assembly, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  incl. the required </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  staffing level (up to 2. crews), incl. all required machines,    tools and materials (shaft installation, fittings etc.) must </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  be carried out within a period of 6 - max. 8 h on the same working day </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  and completed.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- All coordination work required in terms of timing (call off [PERSON_029], shut off</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  go back into operation) is to be discussed and agreed in good time before the planned execution with       the responsible water master. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- After completion of the work the water pipeline must imperatively be put back into </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  operation!</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- The surcharge - item for the civil works is paid separately in the trade civil works </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  water pipeline.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">- The coordination of civil and assembly works is to take place internally between the </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">  civil works and pipe-laying company.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;">Note:</span>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;"> A deviation from the time requirement tendered here is not </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">               permitted , the connection at the end of construction of the water pipeline DZ NZ </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">               Isnyberg - 365 is to be executed separately in time and is also </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">               paid separately! </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">               The estimator has, with regard to labour effort and logistics, all </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">               additional expenditure compared with the otherwise tendered </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">               LV - items to include here in the surcharge - item.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">              </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;"> There is no payment beyond this!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge - item for all pipe-laying and assembly works </span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
