                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">               LV - items here in the surcharge - item.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">              </span>
                              <span style="font-weight:bold;background:#FFFFFF;"> No payment beyond this is made!</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge - item for all civil works in the connection area new line/</span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
