                    <Qty>5.000</Qty>
                    <QU>St</QU>
                    <Description>
                      <CompleteText>
                        <DetailTxt>
                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Socket of PE, for heated-tool socket welding, for pressure pipeline of PE, for drinking water DIN EN 12201, DVGW GW 335-B2, DN/OD 355, SDR 11, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">on [ORT_031] for drinking water, of PE DIN 8074 and DIN 8075, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">PE 100, outside diameter 355 mm, wall thickness 32,2 mm,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">with a bi - axially oriented polymer - matrix - film with embedded </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">metallic diffussion barrier as permeation barrier and a protective jacket of modified polyolefin compound. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Produce acc. to the requirements of the valid technical guidelines of the DVS (DVS 2207 [ORT_016] 1)</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">the pipe joints are to be made acc. to the manufacturer's current technical laying instructions,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The documentation is to be submitted unrequested for commissioning of the line.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">In addition to the removal and restoration of the protective jacket with </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">diffussion barrier acc. to manufacturer's specifications, for each welded joint, as outer closure and protection of the joint in the course of the directional drilling, </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">a matching shrink sleeve incl. material is to be produced.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution in the area of the transition open-cut construction to the directional drilling.</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
                        </DetailTxt>
                        <OutlineText>
                          <OutlTxt>
                            <TextOutlTxt>
                              <p>
                                <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Socket of PE, for heated-tool socket welding, for pressure pipeline of PE, for drinking water DIN EN 12201, DVGW GW 335-B2, DN/OD 355, SDR 11, </span>
                              </p>
                            </TextOutlTxt>
                          </OutlTxt>
                        </OutlineText>
                      </CompleteText>
                    </Description>
                  </Item>
