                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Overall height: 290 mm, weight: 14 kg</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Accessories: - intake strainer insert automatic intake shut-off in case of flooding.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p/>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Ventilation chimney with removable [PERSON_088] of [PERSON_115] see separate surcharge item!</span>
