                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Install displaced material in the construction area.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Possible gravel supplies and removing material displaced thereby,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">are paid separately. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Connection to concrete structure d = approx. 15 cm for pipe DN 160 </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">by means of core drilling and</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">watertight wall penetration, produce completely.</span>
                            </p>
                          </Text>
