                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Ball fitting DN 100</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">incl. removing abuttment made of concrete in the shaft.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Dispose of all materials arising.</span>
