                            <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Pressure test DIN EN 805, as preliminary test, pressure drop test and main pressure test by the water loss method, on [ORT_031] made of PE, for [PERSON_029], nominal pressure 1,6 MPa (16 bar), DN/OD 355,</span>
                            <br/>
                          </Text>
                          <TextComplement Kind="Owner" MarkLbl="11" ArtChrIdent="20783">
                            <ComplCaption>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">max. pipeline length </span>
                            </ComplCaption>
                            <ComplBodyDec Value="430"/>
