                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">for standstill times not caused by the AN,</span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">the charge-out rate for the respective workers covers all expenses such as wage and salary costs, ancillary wage and salary costs, supplements, wage-bound and wage-dependent costs, other social costs, overheads, risk and profit.</span>
                            </p>
                            <p/>
                            <p style="text-align:justify;">
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Execution in 2 spatially separate  sections is to be included in the price. </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Billing here is by hours spent for both directional bores!</span>
