                          <Text>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Surcharge to the item welded joint heated-tool - butt welding </span>
                            </p>
                            <p>
                              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">PE AD/WD 355/32,2 mm for:</span>
