        <BoQCtgy ID="GW_2008341" RNoPart="05">
          <LblTx>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">HOURLY-RATE WORK FOR THE ENTIRE BILL OF QUANTITIES</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="font-weight:normal;background:#FFFFFF;">Hourly-rate work is work that cannot be recorded in detail in advance of the tender and cannot be priced in work items.</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="font-weight:normal;background:#FFFFFF;">Transition works surfaces road and path construction</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="font-weight:normal;background:#FFFFFF;">with adjustments to the existing.</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="font-weight:normal;background:#FFFFFF;">Transition works existing water pipeline / new water pipeline with house connections.</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="font-weight:normal;background:#FFFFFF;">In the course of an emergency supply house connection line, unforeseeable </span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="font-weight:normal;background:#FFFFFF;">services.</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="font-weight:normal;background:#FFFFFF;">The emergency supply from the house connection is to be billed in the </span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="font-weight:normal;background:#FFFFFF;">corresponding LV - item!</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Note on pricing:</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Hourly-rate work is planned for all tendered trades</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">and must be expressly agreed before execution acc. to VOB/B § 2 paragraph 10  + § 15.</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Billing is by actual hours spent on the verified services.</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">The estimator is strongly advised to price the unit prices of the individual LV - items in the bid with customary local prices.</span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;">
              <span style="background:#FFFFFF;">Should the unit prices be offered excessively high, the AG reserves the right not to agree any hourly-rate work! </span>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align:justify;"/>
          </LblTx>
          <NotApplBoQ>No</NotApplBoQ>
          <BoQBody>
            <BoQCtgy ID="GW_2008342" RNoPart="01">
